## Phase 7: Integration & Testing (Day 6-7)

### End-to-End Test

```bash
# 1. Create plan
npm run plan:create Sennheiser https://www.sennheiser.com open-back

# 2. Approve plan
npm run plan:approve sennheiser-open-back-2026-04-02

# 3. Scrape
npm run scrape sennheiser-open-back-2026-04-02

# 4. Transform
npm run transform sennheiser-open-back-2026-04-02-001

# 5. Review (interactive)
npm run review sennheiser-open-back-2026-04-02-001

# 6. Upload dry run
npm run upload sennheiser-open-back-2026-04-02-001 --dry-run

# 7. Upload
npm run upload sennheiser-open-back-2026-04-02-001
```

