## Success Criteria

- [ ] Can create and approve a scrape plan
- [ ] Can execute scrape (respecting rate limits)
- [ ] Can transform raw data to Sanity schema
- [ ] Integrity checks catch: missing fields, new brands, duplicate SKUs
- [ ] Can review and approve/reject individual products
- [ ] Can upload approved products to Sanity
- [ ] Images are uploaded as Sanity assets
- [ ] Products appear in Sanity Studio with correct catalogueLocationKeys
- [ ] Upload reports guide next steps (Stripe setup)

---

## Post-Implementation

After pipeline is working:
1. Run pilot: 1 manufacturer, 10 products
2. Fix any issues
3. Scale to multiple sources
4. Add automation (scheduled scrapes) if needed
5. Build web UI if CLI becomes cumbersome

